---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="about">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading
      id="about"
      index="01"
      title="About"
      subtitle="A career shaped by curiosity, ownership, and steady growth"
    />
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>
          I started in web development in 2017 and gradually moved closer to the systems and decisions behind products.
          Today I work across implementation, planning, and team support — keeping technical choices understandable and useful.
        </p>
        <p>
          My default is pragmatic: make the problem clear, choose a direction, and leave the codebase easier to change than
          I found it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-principles" aria-label="Working principles">
        <article>
          <span class="principle-index mono">01</span>
          <h3>Clarity</h3>
          <p>Make decisions and trade-offs easier to understand.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="principle-index mono">02</span>
          <h3>Ownership</h3>
          <p>Stay accountable from the first question to the shipped result.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="principle-index mono">03</span>
          <h3>Continuity</h3>
          <p>Prefer improvements that compound over time.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
